(6916473, 1043087, 114285, '<td valign="top">You did all this with minimal editing, not sure how you got the vignetting there, unless it was in camera.<br/> <br/>Anyway:<br/>10 for effort<br/>10 for time spent creating this<br/>10 for those eyes<br/>10 for uniqueness<br/>8 for exposure, seems under exposed, might be on purpose although not sure why!<br/> <br/>So that''s an avg of 9.6!<br/> <br/>And I guess you win!</td>', 'You did all this with minimal editing, not sure how you got the vignetting there, unless it was in camera. Anyway:10 for effort10 for time spent creating this10 for those eyes10 for uniqueness8 for exposure, seems under exposed, might be on purpose although not sure why! So that''s an avg of 9.6! And I guess you win!', '2012-11-30 02:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
