(6925579, 1043087, 28742, '<td valign="top">Holy crap - look at the distance between you and second place 7.87 - 6.18 ! <br/>I know you hate minimal, Christophe (and so do I) but I love how you kick ass under any constraints. There is no question your skills, tenacity and patience exceed anyone else''s here - frankly I don''t believe you are from this planet. Congrats! Where do you go from here? how long will you keep this up?</td>', 'Holy crap - look at the distance between you and second place 7.87 - 6.18 ! I know you hate minimal, Christophe (and so do I) but I love how you kick ass under any constraints. There is no question your skills, tenacity and patience exceed anyone else''s here - frankly I don''t believe you are from this planet. Congrats! Where do you go from here? how long will you keep this up?', '2012-12-07 01:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
