(6925657, 1042695, 114969, '<td valign="top">Ok, now I''m hungry! Congratulations on your nice finish. I was convinced you would get a ribbon though, very nice work. I''m quite sure you had a blast eating your entry anyway! ;-)</td>', 'Ok, now I''m hungry! Congratulations on your nice finish. I was convinced you would get a ribbon though, very nice work. I''m quite sure you had a blast eating your entry anyway! ;-)', '2012-12-07 05:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6925659, 1043198, 114969, '<td valign="top">Samantha, I really find amusing how we both arrived at the same conclusion: indoor setup for reproducibility and lighting control, black &amp; white in order to minimize color management problems. I also like the fact you included some "uncontrolled" flying elements. I am quite surprised about your score though, I would have rated it much higher! Congratulations on the top 10 anyway.</td>', 'Samantha, I really find amusing how we both arrived at the same conclusion: indoor setup for reproducibility and lighting control, black & white in order to minimize color management problems. I also like the fact you included some "uncontrolled" flying elements. I am quite surprised about your score though, I would have rated it much higher! Congratulations on the top 10 anyway.', '2012-12-07 06:03:10.000000', NULL, 0),
