(6925909, 1043092, 140305, '<td valign="top">My dad used to keep his old plates hanging on the wall in the garage. I don`t know why he did it, but after moving a few times they eventually disappeared. My dad is gone now. When I saw this image during voting, it made me think about him &amp; his plates, a good, nostalgic feeling. Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'My dad used to keep his old plates hanging on the wall in the garage. I don`t know why he did it, but after moving a few times they eventually disappeared. My dad is gone now. When I saw this image during voting, it made me think about him & his plates, a good, nostalgic feeling. Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2012-12-07 10:54:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6925911, 1042820, 19825, '<td valign="top">I like this image -- I was one of your 7''s. For me (and I may be slow) it was a tad disorienting at first and then it took a moment to sort out what I was looking at. Requiring the viewer to linger in order to understand can be a wonderful thing, but my theory on why this underachieved in score that some voters in a hurry may have blown past it without taking a moment. Much as blindjustice said, the tones and contrasts are terrific. I love the big smiles and bare legs and shoulders of the dancers contrasted by the more dour, bundled riders. I wonder if you had cropped just a tiny bit higher and/or lower so folks could recognize it is a double decker bus a bit more quickly if this might have scored higher.</td>', 'I like this image -- I was one of your 7''s. For me (and I may be slow) it was a tad disorienting at first and then it took a moment to sort out what I was looking at. Requiring the viewer to linger in order to understand can be a wonderful thing, but my theory on why this underachieved in score that some voters in a hurry may have blown past it without taking a moment. Much as blindjustice said, the tones and contrasts are terrific. I love the big smiles and bare legs and shoulders of the dancers contrasted by the more dour, bundled riders. I wonder if you had cropped just a tiny bit higher and/or lower so folks could recognize it is a double decker bus a bit more quickly if this might have scored higher.', '2012-12-07 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6925962, 1043087, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is just magnificent, the description alone is worth the price of admission :-)</td>', 'This is just magnificent, the description alone is worth the price of admission :-)', '2012-12-07 11:23:59.000000', NULL, 0),
