(6928099, 1043092, 68503, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by flaherma:</b></div><hr/><i> My dad used to keep his old plates hanging on the wall in the garage. I don`t know why he did it, but after moving a few times they eventually disappeared. My dad is gone now. When I saw this image during voting, it made me think about him &amp; his plates, a good, nostalgic feeling. Congratulations on the ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Im glad my picture was able to bring back some good memories, thats a big part of what photography is about.</td>', 'Originally posted by flaherma: My dad used to keep his old plates hanging on the wall in the garage. I don`t know why he did it, but after moving a few times they eventually disappeared. My dad is gone now. When I saw this image during voting, it made me think about him & his plates, a good, nostalgic feeling. Congratulations on the ribbon!   Im glad my picture was able to bring back some good memories, thats a big part of what photography is about.', '2012-12-09 10:45:04.000000', NULL, 0),
