(6962287, 1042354, 41337, '<td valign="top">In a different context or rendering, the shadow might produce an ominous feeling, but here it comes across as an ambivalent overseer, caretaker or teacher. Either way its presence gives the photo more depth and enjoyment, IMO.</td>', 'In a different context or rendering, the shadow might produce an ominous feeling, but here it comes across as an ambivalent overseer, caretaker or teacher. Either way its presence gives the photo more depth and enjoyment, IMO.', '2013-01-21 21:38:01.000000', NULL, 0);
